---
description: Engine-shell IPC and /say HTTP surface
globs: kuro-rs/crates/kuro-ipc/**
alwaysApply: false
---
`kuro-ipc/src/lib.rs` is PROTECTED: stop without user ADR and `ADR: NNNN` trailer.
Keep handshake and JSON shapes aligned with `contract/` snapshots and parity tests.
Token checks use `kuro-core` token helpers; bind HTTP to 127.0.0.1 only.
`/say` scope and auth changes need ADR 0019 cited or a new ADR.
Contract or live daemon tests must pass after protocol edits.
Do not move tool execution or routing into this crate.
Prefer extending tests in `kuro-ipc/tests/` over manual shell-only verification.